# Dorr Frontend Standards

Full guide: `docs/16-STYLEGUIDE.md`

## Two SPAs

| SPA | Entry | Axios | Router base |
|-----|-------|-------|-------------|
| Admin | `app.js` | `adminAxios` | `/admin` |
| User | `user-app.js` | `userAxios` | `/user` |

Never mix axios clients or token keys (`admin_token` vs `user_token`).

## Admin CRUD pages

Reuse `composables/crudStructure.js` + entity composable (`useCountries`, etc.) + Pinia count store.

Pattern: `views/{entity}/index.vue` + `ModalCreateAndUpdate.vue`.

## Forms

- Admin modals: Vuelidate via `useValidation.js`
- All UI strings: `$t()` / `t()` in **both** `locales/ar.json` and `locales/en.json`

## Do not

- Add hardcoded Arabic/English strings in templates
- Duplicate CRUD logic outside `crudStructure`
- Use PrimeVue in user SPA (`user-main.js` has no PrimeVue)
- Create `resources/js/modules/website/` without approved plan (NEEDS-DECISION)
